  "bodyHash": "+5YFj7W4vN8=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum模组，用心制作，为Fabric、Forge和Neo提供众多活跃模组。\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于本模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">堆叠补充（Stack Refill）是一款实用模组，当玩家背包中有同种物品时，它会自动补充玩家手中的物品堆。适用于战斗中的武器、挖掘方块的工具、放置方块时的堆叠、食用食物、使用药水、扔出物品、饮用牛奶桶、钓竿损坏时，并且应该能与所有模组方块兼容。这是我个人最喜欢的便利性改进之一。<br><br>为了获得最佳体验，需要在<strong>客户端</strong>和<strong>服务器</strong>上都安装。仅服务器端安装也可使用，但可能会导致一些视觉上的不同步。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于The Vanilla Experience整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于Serilum的QoL合集包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端和服务器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>战斗中自动替换剑：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"584\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>挖泥土时自动替换锹：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"584\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>放置原木时自动补充：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"586\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>食用面包后自动补充：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"588\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>饮用药水后自动补充：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"588\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>扔出物品后自动补充：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"608\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>饮用牛奶桶后自动补充：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/g.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"580\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>钓竿最后使用后自动替换新钓竿：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/h.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"580\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在（模组）方块上使用物品时，例如Ex Nihilo的筛子：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/i.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"516\"></span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注和链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组，只要下载链接仍托管在CurseForge或Modrinth生态系统内。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论已禁用，因为我无法在这么多独立的模组页面上跟进反馈。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
